      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westworth_Village%2C_Texas",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "When Carswell became Naval Air Station Joint Reserve Base Fort Worth in 1998, the city converted 400 acres of former federal land into a mixed‑use urban development.",
